# Bot1 takes Bot2's Grizzly Bears, equipped with Bot2's The Dominion Bracelet, with Act of Treason. The Bracelet stays Bot2's
# (CR 301.5d), but the ability it grants is the Bears', so only Bot1 can activate it (CR 602.2). "Exile The Dominion Bracelet"
# names the Bracelet that granted it (CR 201.5a), and unlike a sacrifice (CR 701.21a) no rule limits it to a permanent Bot1
# controls: Bot1 pays {12} (power 3), exiles Bot2's Bracelet, and controls Bot2 during Bot2's next turn (CR 723.1).

